---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="My Portfolio" currentTab="Bio">
    <div id="Bio" class="tab-content active-tab" style="display: block;">
        <section id="about">
            <h2>About</h2>
            <p>Computer Science student at Ton Duc Thang University with a strong foundation in Python, Machine Learning, and NLP. Passionate about researching and building real-world AI applications, specializing in model fine-tuning, RAG architectures, and scalable system integration.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="education">
            <h2>Education</h2>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title">Bachelor of Computer Science | Ton Duc Thang University</span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Oct 2022 – May 2026</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>GPA:</strong> 3.2/4.00</li>
                    <li><strong>Awards:</strong> Academic Promotion Scholarship (Semester 2, 2025)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="experience">
            <h2>Experience</h2>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://www.nng.com.vn/blog/welcoming-the-emba-from-foster-school-of-business-at-the-university-of-washington" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open external link">AI Intern | NNG Company Limited <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Aug 2025 – Oct 2025</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Researched and explored Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architectures and their practical applications in business contexts.</li>
                    <li>Engaged in professional software development workflows and corporate training sessions.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://sportplus.vn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open external link">AI Intern | SPORTPLUS JSC <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Jun 2025 – Jul 2025</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Developed a data crawling tool using Python to extract player performance scores from the DUPR sports application.</li>
                    <li>Processed and structured extracted raw data to align with machine learning preprocessing requirements.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2>Projects</h2>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://github.com/Senju14/Speech_to_text-realtime-for-lecture-hall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open project link">Bilingual Real-Time Speech-to-Text System <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Thesis / Academic Research</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Building a real-time academic lecture transcription and translation application (Vietnamese/English).</li>
                    <li>Developing a live audio streaming pipeline utilizing FastAPI, WebSockets, and Silero VAD for efficient audio segmentation.</li>
                    <li>Integrating WhisperX and NLLB models, deploying on Modal serverless GPUs for high-speed inference.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://github.com/Senju14/agentic-rag-001" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open project link">Agentic RAG System <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Aug 2025 – Oct 2025</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Engineered a multi-agent retrieval system to process, search, and answer complex queries from business documents.</li>
                    <li>Utilized Pinecone vector database and Knowledge Graphs to optimize text chunk storage and retrieval accuracy.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://github.com/Senju14/vi-vqa-animals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open project link">VI-VQA Animals <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Deep Learning</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Developed a Vietnamese visual question answering project focused on animal understanding tasks.</li>
                </ul>
                <!-- Link nhúng trực tiếp chuẩn của Hugging Face -->
                <div class="hf-space-wrapper">
                    <iframe src="https://522h0134-nguyennhathuy-vi-vqa-animals.hf.space" title="Hugging Face Space" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://github.com/Senju14/re-shopping-cart-website" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open project link">Re Shopping Cart Website <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">Rikkei Seminar</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Learn CI/CD, Github Actions, Docker.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="awards">
            <h2>Honors & Awards</h2>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://it.tdtu.edu.vn/truong-dai-hoc-ton-duc-thang-dat-giai-nhi-tai-olympic-tri-tue-nhan-tao-sinh-vien-viet-nam-lan-thu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open award link">Second Prize | Vietnam Student AI Olympiad <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">2025</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Demonstrated advanced logical thinking and practical problem-solving in a highly competitive national-level AI modeling competition.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-header">
                    <span class="item-title"><a href="https://it.tdtu.edu.vn/trien-lam2425/17" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="ext-link" title="Click to open award link">Scientific Research Award | Ton Duc Thang University <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square link-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></span>
                    <span class="item-meta">2024</span>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>Recognized for outstanding NLP research by building a Vietnamese Tourism Q&A dataset (SQUAD 2.0 format).</li>
                    <li>Fine-tuned RoBERTa and PhoBERT models to enhance machine reading comprehension performance.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="skills">
            <h2>Skills</h2>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <span class="skill-category">Languages:</span>
                <span>Python, Java, SQL</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <span class="skill-category">AI & ML:</span>
                <span>PyTorch, Hugging Face, NLP (WhisperX, NLLB, LLMs), Computer Vision, RAG, Multi-Agent Systems</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <span class="skill-category">Web & APIs:</span>
                <span>FastAPI, Spring Boot, WebSockets, RESTful APIs, HTML/CSS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="skills-grid">
                <span class="skill-category">Cloud & DevOps:</span>
                <span>AWS, Modal, Docker, Git, GitHub Actions (CI/CD)</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>
